                <div class="essay">
                    <h3>The Heathers Act II, the journey to the underworld</h3>
                    <div class="essay-date">January 2026</div>
                    <p>The follow up essay to An archetypal analysis of The Heathers, focusing on specific elements of the monomyth and Jung</p>
                </div>
